## ADR & Standards Audit

**Auditor:** ADR & Standards Enforcer · **Date:** 2026-09-15 · **Mission:** `q-b0f6/m-dfe1`

Read in full: every document in the `decisions` group (28), all six `standards`
documents, `technical-test-guidelines`, `conceptual-workflows-error-handling`,
`-health`, `-help`, `-json-output`, and the PRD. Read in source: `doctrine.py`,
`knight.py`, `paths.py`, `models.py`, `api.py`, `safewrite.py`, plus the
doctrine / knight / health / mission / show regions of `cli.py`, `db.py`,
`health.py`, `frontmatter_edit.py`, `oracle.py`, `init.py` and `prompts.py`.

Three conflicts settled before this mission — `decisions-006-id-references`
edited in place, `read_doctrine`'s two miss shapes, and `frontmatter_edit`'s
repointed `doctrine` kind — were treated as closed and are not reopened.

